
### Create a task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn MERN stack",
  "description": "Build my TaskFlow application",
  "priority": "High",
  "completed": false
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks


### Update a task
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ad9f11dfb8a4e11e93decd7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}


###

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ad9f11dfb8a4e11e93decd7
